WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Hello, my name is Efraim.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.400
As you can see, I'm moving my head right and left, up and down.

3
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.100
Until a few weeks ago, I couldn't move.

4
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.000
I had an epidural injection, and it didn't help.

5
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.600
Then I was advised to have this treatment, on the machine you see here next to me,

6
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:29.400
an electrical device, together with manual therapy.

7
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.600
And now, after about five weeks,

8
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.000
I'm a new man.
